s and technical competence support reliability and technical competence. While B's communication tone is a concern, it may be mitigated compared to C's egocentric and low education willingness.\n\nThus public message: I shift my vote to B, referencing the new info from agents about lack of stress resilience for C and B's stress handling, and crew cooperation concerns for B but still stronger overall.\n\nLet's produce final."}
